Package: dirsearch
Version: 0.5.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Alienkrishn [Anon4You]
Depends: python, python-pip, git, rust
Section: web
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/maurosoria/dirsearch
Description: Web path scanner
 dirsearch is a command-line tool designed to brute force directories
 and files in web servers using a dictionary attack.
